Package: ishtaria-datadisk-tutorial
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ishtaria-server
Description: Tutorial story datadisk for Ishtaria worlds
 A comprehensive tutorial datadisk demonstrating all implemented Ishtaria features.
 Learn movement, gathering, crafting, combat, trading, building, magic, and more
 in a guided experience through Tutorial Island.
 .
 The datadisk is installed to /usr/share/ishtaria/datadisks/tutorial and is
 taken into account by worlds generated with it selected in ishtaria-admin.
 .
